{"seq":1,"slug":"determinacy","title":"决定性：用无穷博弈一举兑现全部正则性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/practice/determinacy","wordCount":1672,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"决定性-用无穷博弈一举兑现全部正则性\">决定性：用无穷博弈一举兑现全部正则性</h1><p>前三章反复出现一个悬念：解析层以上的正则性质「独立于 ZFC，需要额外公理」。这一篇揭晓那把统一的钥匙——决定性。它的思想惊人地简洁：把每个集合变成一场无穷长的双人博弈，若这场博弈总有一方存在必胜策略，那个集合就同时获得完美集性质、Baire 性质与勒贝格可测性。于是三条看似无关的正则性质被收进同一个来源。决定性还架起了描述集合论与大基数理论之间最深的桥：投影层级每一层的正则性，精确对应着若干个 Woodin 基数的存在。这一篇讲清博弈与策略、Borel 决定性这条 ZFC 定理、投影决定性 PD 与决定性公理 AD 的层次，以及它们与大基数的强度对应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-无穷博弈与必胜策略\">核心概念：无穷博弈与必胜策略</h2><p>给定集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⊆</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}^{\\mathbb{N}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8452em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8452em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathbb mtight\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，博弈 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 这样进行：玩家 I 与 II 轮流报自然数</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>I</mtext><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>II</mtext><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>I</mtext><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>II</mtext><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⋯</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{I}: a_0\\quad \\text{II}: a_1\\quad \\text{I}: a_2\\quad \\text{II}: a_3\\quad\\cdots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">II</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">II</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>产生无穷序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=(a_0,a_1,a_2,\\dots)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。约定：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\in A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 则 I 胜，否则 II 胜。一名玩家的<strong>策略</strong>是一个函数，输入当前已报出的有限序列、输出下一步该报的数。策略<strong>必胜</strong>，如果无论对手怎么走都保证己方赢。集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 被称为<strong>被决定的（determined）</strong>，如果 I 或 II 之一拥有必胜策略。</p>\n<p>并非所有集合都被决定：用选择公理可以造出未被决定的集合（沿全体策略的良序对角线破坏每个策略）。于是「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 被决定」本身就是对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的一种正则性约束——恰如可测、有 BP 一样，是「可定义集合才配拥有」的好性质。**决定性公理（AD）**断言「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{N}^{\\mathbb{N}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8452em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8452em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathbb mtight\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的所有子集都被决定」，它与完全选择公理矛盾，只能在放弃 AC 的模型里成立。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;集合 A ⊆ N^N&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;博弈 G(A):&lt;br/&gt;I,II 轮流报自然数&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C{&quot;某方有必胜策略?&quot;}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[&quot;A 被决定&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|否, 靠 AC 构造| E[&quot;未决定集合&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;完美集博弈 ⟹ PSP&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G[&quot;Banach-Mazur ⟹ Baire 性质&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; H[&quot;协变博弈 ⟹ 勒贝格可测&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; I[&quot;三大正则性质&lt;br/&gt;同一来源兑现&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"集合 A ⊆ N^N\"] --&gt; B[\"博弈 G(A):&lt;br/&gt;I,II 轮流报自然数\"]\n  B --&gt; C{\"某方有必胜策略?\"}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[\"A 被决定\"]\n  C --&gt;|否, 靠 AC 构造| E[\"未决定集合\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"完美集博弈 ⟹ PSP\"]\n  D --&gt; G[\"Banach-Mazur ⟹ Baire 性质\"]\n  D --&gt; H[\"协变博弈 ⟹ 勒贝格可测\"]\n  F --&gt; I[\"三大正则性质&lt;br/&gt;同一来源兑现\"]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"gale-stewart-与-martin-的-borel-决定性\">Gale–Stewart 与 Martin 的 Borel 决定性</h2><p>决定性能免费拿到多少？两块基石回答了这个问题。</p>\n<p><strong>Gale–Stewart 定理（1953）</strong>：每个开集（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^0_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）与闭集（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Π</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Pi}^0_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Π</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）都被决定。证明用「非丢局位置」的组合论证——若 I 无必胜策略，II 可以永远停在「I 仍无必胜策略」的位置上，这套后向归纳直接给出 II 的必胜策略。这是 ZFC 内最基础的决定性，也是 <a href=\"../hierarchies/borel-hierarchy\">Borel 层级</a> 里 Wadge 博弈可用的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>Borel 决定性定理（Martin, 1975）</strong>：每个 Borel 集都被决定。这是纯 ZFC 定理，不需要任何大基数，却是 ZFC 能证明的决定性极限——Martin 后来证明它的证明本质上必须用到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 层的幂集迭代（不可避免地消耗大量的替换公理），即 Borel 决定性在证明论强度上已相当高。跨过 Borel 一步到解析集，ZFC 就再也证不动了：<strong>解析决定性等价于「存在一个可测基数（每个实数的锐 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^\\#</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">#</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 存在）」</strong>，这是决定性与大基数挂钩的第一个精确等价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"正则性质的统一兑现\">正则性质的统一兑现</h2><p>决定性的价值在于它一次性供应全部正则性质。对每条性质，都能设计一个专门的博弈，使「集合被决定」直接翻译成「集合规矩」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>正则性质</th>\n<th>对应博弈</th>\n<th>决定性如何兑现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完美集性质</td>\n<td>完美集博弈（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∗</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ast</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span></span></span></span></span>-game）</td>\n<td>II 必胜 ⟹ 构造完美子树；I 必胜 ⟹ 集合可数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Baire 性质</td>\n<td>Banach–Mazur 博弈</td>\n<td>见 <a href=\"../regularity/baire-property\">Baire 性质</a>：II 必胜 ⟺ 余贫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>勒贝格可测</td>\n<td>协变/覆盖博弈（covering game）</td>\n<td>必胜策略给出内外测度逼近</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>因此一条「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Gamma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定性」的假设，自动给整个点类 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Gamma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 装上三大正则性质。这解释了前三章反复出现的「独立于 ZFC」为何能被统一处理——不必逐条为可测、BP、PSP 寻找公理，只需一个决定性假设。这正是决定性作为「统一但昂贵」的来源的意义：它把三条战线合并成一条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"投影决定性-ad-与-woodin-基数\">投影决定性、AD 与 Woodin 基数</h2><p>把决定性限制在投影集上，得到<strong>投影决定性（PD）</strong>：所有投影集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^1_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>）都被决定。PD 与完全选择公理相容（因为投影集是「可定义的少数」，不触发对角线反例），因而可以作为对 ZFC 的自然补充。它的力量正好补上 <a href=\"../hierarchies/projective-hierarchy\">投影层级</a> 那张枢纽表的全部空缺——在 PD 下，每个投影集都可测、有 BP、有 PSP，且预良序与均匀化的层间交替模式被完全确定。</p>\n<p>PD 的一致性来自大基数，这是 Martin–Steel–Woodin 在 1980 年代末完成的深刻定理：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>存在无穷多个 Woodin 基数</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>PD</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>n</mi><mtext> 个 Woodin 基数</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mtext> 决定性</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{存在无穷多个 Woodin 基数} \\implies \\text{PD};\\qquad n \\text{ 个 Woodin 基数} \\implies \\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^1_{n+1} \\text{ 决定性}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7184em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">存在无穷多个</span><span class=\"mord\"> Woodin </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">基数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PD</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">个</span><span class=\"mord\"> Woodin </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">基数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1954em;vertical-align:-0.3053em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">决定性</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>逐级对应精确到「一个 Woodin 基数 ⟺ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^1_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定性」这种程度。更强的<strong>决定性公理 AD</strong> 断言所有集合被决定；它在完整宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 里与 AC 冲突，但 Woodin 证明「存在无穷多 Woodin 基数 + 一个可测基数在其上」蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊨</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(\\mathbb{R})\\models\\mathrm{AD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">AD</span></span></span></span></span></span>——即在只含实数及其构造的内模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(\\mathbb{R})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 里，AD 成立，那里所有实数集统统规矩。截至 2020 年代，这套「大基数 ⟺ 决定性 ⟺ 正则性」的三角对应仍是集合论最坚实的成就之一，Sandra Müller 等人近年的综述持续在推进 AD<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与更高层内模型的边界（维也纳工大，2024）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>博弈 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：I、II 轮流报自然数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\in A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 则 I 胜；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 被决定 = 某方有必胜策略。被决定本身是一种正则性，未被决定集合需选择公理构造。</li>\n<li>Gale–Stewart 给出开/闭集决定性；Martin 的 Borel 决定性是 ZFC 极限；解析决定性 ⟺ 存在可测基数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^\\#</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">#</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），是与大基数挂钩的第一个等价。</li>\n<li>决定性统一兑现三大正则性质：完美集博弈 ⟹ PSP，Banach–Mazur ⟹ BP，协变博弈 ⟹ 可测——一个假设合并三条战线。</li>\n<li>PD 与 AC 相容，补齐投影层级全部空缺；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个 Woodin 基数 ⟹ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^1_{n+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1954em;vertical-align:-0.3053em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定性，无穷多 Woodin ⟹ PD 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊨</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(\\mathbb{R})\\models</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊨</span></span></span></span></span> AD。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章邻篇：<a href=\"borel-equivalence\">Borel 等价关系</a> —— 决定性也用于分类问题的二分定理。</li>\n<li>决定性填补的正则性空缺：<a href=\"../regularity/perfect-set-property\">完美集性质</a>、<a href=\"../regularity/baire-property\">Baire 性质</a>、<a href=\"../regularity/measurability\">勒贝格可测性</a>。</li>\n<li>决定性支配的层间结构：<a href=\"../hierarchies/projective-hierarchy\">投影层级</a>。</li>\n<li>博弈、策略、必胜的一般理论：<a href=\"../../game-theory/foundations/what-is-a-game\">博弈论 · 什么是博弈</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"决定性：用无穷博弈一举兑现全部正则性","id":"决定性-用无穷博弈一举兑现全部正则性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：无穷博弈与必胜策略","id":"核心概念-无穷博弈与必胜策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Gale–Stewart 与 Martin 的 Borel 决定性","id":"gale-stewart-与-martin-的-borel-决定性"},{"level":2,"text":"正则性质的统一兑现","id":"正则性质的统一兑现"},{"level":2,"text":"投影决定性、AD 与 Woodin 基数","id":"投影决定性-ad-与-woodin-基数"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"勒贝格可测性：可定义就不会失去测度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/regularity/measurability"},"next":{"title":"Borel 等价关系：给「分类有多难」一把标尺","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/practice/borel-equivalence"}}